WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Start narration: character, captions and progress move together.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Pause and retain the current position.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Select chapter two and seek to the product explanation.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Resume from the selected chapter.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Select chapter three to change the gesture and script.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Replay from the beginning.
